Schema fix during build (zod ↔ react-hook-form integration)
===========================================================
Initial schema had `countryCode: z.string().length(2).default("PL")`.
zod's `.default()` makes the field optional in INPUT but required
in OUTPUT; react-hook-form's Resolver generic doesn't tolerate the
split (Type 'string | undefined' is not assignable to type 'string'
when resolving against ResolverOptions). Fix: drop the zod default,
keep the value from react-hook-form's `defaultValues: { countryCode:
"PL" }`. Single line. Build clean afterwards.

Cache fix during smoke (Next.js dev)
====================================
First curl smoke returned 404 for /register/organization despite
production build emitting the route. Cause: `.next/dev/` retained a
stale route manifest from before the new page.tsx was added.
`rm -rf .next/dev && Preview MCP restart` brought the route up.
Worth flagging in CLAUDE.md if it recurs — for now treat it as a
one-time hiccup.

